        $h .= $help('Combination disk: a zone increase of 5 mm or more with clavulanate over the same agent alone confirms an ESBL producer. Both discs of the pair must be read by combination disk; the server applies the same rule on save.');
        $h .= '</div></div>';

        /* ---- Carbapenems Test ---- */
        // START ESBL / CARBAPENEMASE CHANGE
        /* Antibiotic (IMI / EPT / MER), then the method. mCIM follows the
           decision rule; Carba NP / PCR / Other take a stated interpretation
           instead (bpMcimInterpret switches the rows). Mode-dependent
